  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  repeatLines: 0
  NPCName: 
  DayLines:
  - ...
  SunsetLines:
  - ...
  NightLines:
  - Oh! Who are you? Oh, right. You must be one of the cops we called for hours ago.
  - Old man Jebediah has lost his head. Not literally of course, forgive my language...
    I mean simply that he's gone mad.
  - He was screaming something about protection and an eye for an eye. He opened
    the safe, but I'm not sure what he grabbed from inside.
  - He was muttering about his birthdate while putting in the combination. This is
    the Berryl mansion, so there may be some clue around.
